andidate</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:2e658c79a180d1f124012533e7d8cbd09668bfbe19fb3257f41ad2cc0dea54ae</id><updated>2026-09-10T12:58:37Z</updated><published>2026-09-10T05:53:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/serbia-the-conflicted-eu-candidate/a-79203774--0a94078faf3f.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/serbia-the-conflicted-eu-candidate/a-79203774?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">On paper, Belgrade has pursued EU membership for years. But accession has long been stalled. The hero's farewell given to war criminal Mladic exposed just how far Serbia has alienated itself from Europe.</summary><category term="World" /></entry><entry><title>August hottest month ever recorded, says EU monitor</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:1bb3cf92ba2e2262636d2b58f4b847ea245aa0128dde0b3cd0d8c378e5c2539e</id><updated>2026-09-10T12:59:55Z</updated><published>2026-09-10T05:47:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/august-hottest-month-ever-recorded-says-eu-monitor/a-79208462--670386371c18.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/august-hottest-month-ever-recorded-says-eu-monitor/a-79208462?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">The average global temperature in August broke the previous record set in 2023. Climate scientists say record summer heat in the northern hemisphere and warmer oceans are all part of a new normal.</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>Trump promises Americans $5,000 if Republicans win midterms</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:79b266576e610c27b919df887f782e8b194e05a36c91723ec732205fc6321c4f</id><updated>2026-09-10T12:58:37Z</updated><published>2026-09-10T03:44:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/trump-promises-americans-5-000-if-republicans-win-midterms/a-79208399--193518c15bf4.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/trump-promises-americans-5-000-if-republicans-win-midterms/a-79208399?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">The US president gave a wide-ranging speech at the Republican midterm convention. He defended the war in Iran, trade wars and tariffs, and the White House ballroom. He also called Democrats evil and immigrants animals.</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>Philippines: Several killed, dozens missing after fire on ferry</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:a72899593a49df1a97e62ee7d24cf24d16d48b0104838b4a10501086c14b4d0d</id><updated>2026-09-10T12:58:37Z</updated><published>2026-09-10T01:48:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/philippines-several-killed-dozens-missing-after-fire-on-ferry/a-79208236--4b1ef54015f4.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/philippines-several-killed-dozens-missing-after-fire-on-ferry/a-79208236?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">Footage released by the Coast Guard showed the vessel engulfed in flames as rescuers brought bodies ashore in body bags. The ship's manifest listed 134 passengers and crew.</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>Finland: Google announces €13 billion AI, energy investment</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:4713db96984ef40ee0eafccafe831122257f6b715ee1ecd0465c3bb4d8802044</id><updated>2026-09-10T12:58:37Z</updated><published>2026-09-09T22:27:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/finland-google-announces-_13-billion-ai-energy-investment/a-79208034--066f4655241f.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/finland-google-announces-€13-billion-ai-energy-investment/a-79208034?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">Google has announced a plan to expand AI data centers and buy massive amounts of nuclear energy. Finland's security services have warned of there are risks, but the right-wing government says the deal will bring jobs.</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>Norway's PM: Zelenskyy's plane almost hit by drone</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:4c1135e0d0a6cadc0f699a432b879f3e520440b0525e65225c9d6cdf4afb162d</id><updated>2026-09-10T12:58:37Z</updated><published>2026-09-09T20:01:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/norway-s-pm-zelenskyy-s-plane-almost-hit-by-drone/a-79207528--c78d6300cd95.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/norway-s-pm-zelenskyy-s-plane-almost-hit-by-drone/a-79207528?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">A drone nearly struck a plane carrying Ukrainian President Volodymyr Zelenskyy from Moldova to Oslo, according to Norway's prime minister. However, a Ukrainian source said the threat may have been overstated.</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>China: English to be removed as a graded core subject?</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:508aaebce0ba0b75b316f72d9394ad060b1740861ed94fdeed0f11373c7dc199</id><updated>2026-09-10T12:58:37Z</updated><published>2026-09-09T19:34:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/china-english-to-be-removed-as-a-graded-core-subject/a-79199629--52f7a1cb9d3e.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/china-english-to-be-removed-as-a-graded-core-subject/a-79199629?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">A university professor is calling for English to no longer be taught as a graded core subject in Chinese schools. Opponents argue that, in a globalized world, knowing English benefits the country and one's career.</summary><category term="World" /></entry><entry><title>Ceuta: Documents show Spanish intelligence warned of crisis</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:4f256316f3472150e2cbdadd127845e24962fa12f4a70737305bfeb3fd833dd9</id><updated>2026-09-10T12:58:37Z</updated><published>2026-09-09T17:53:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/ceuta-documents-show-spanish-intelligence-warned-of-crisis/a-79206505--1dd65a7f978d.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/ceuta-documents-show-spanish-intelligence-warned-of-crisis/a-79206505?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">Spain declassified documents that showed warnings issued a day before more than 70,000 migrants rushed the Ceuta border fence. Meanwhile, the EU announced funds to strengthen the border and return migrants to Morocco.</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>Germany's connection to the September 11, 2001 attacks</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:906dced0787da2a940588a14eb9fcf77743e955b056e97359a763defb3bf4902</id><updated>2026-09-10T12:58:37Z</updated><published>2026-09-09T17:52:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/germany-s-connection-to-the-september-11-2001-attacks/a-79202918--22a07e00351f.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/germany-s-connection-to-the-september-11-2001-attacks/a-79202918?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">The 9/11 attacks were partly planned in Hamburg, via the so-called Hamburg cell, whose members played key roles in the plot. A look back at a day that shook up Germany’s approach to national security.</summary><category term="World" /></entry><entry><title>Switzerland: Two killed in power plant explosion</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:336e598cb7fc37c48d685d1bc0697d43d91d6955c20db08e08e633766aa4dcdb</id><updated>2026-09-10T12:58:37Z</updated><published>2026-09-09T16:02:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/switzerland-two-killed-in-power-plant-explosion/a-79205516--3f73e13d5b04.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/switzerland-two-killed-in-power-plant-explosion/a-79205516?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">A fire and subsequent explosion have killed two workers at a Swiss hydroelectric power plant. Authorities say the facility suffered major damage in the incident.</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>Iran tightens social control with crackdown on cafes</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:a7bb1b2d391a9f564441785990bcd16cddc62f98965f83ce94e00667be198171</id><updated>2026-09-10T12:58:37Z</updated><published>2026-09-09T15:43:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/iran-tightens-social-control-with-crackdown-on-cafes/a-79204988--56f8af8e2572.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/iran-tightens-social-control-with-crackdown-on-cafes/a-79204988?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">Authorities are keeping a close eye on cafes, fearing they could play a role in fostering anti-government sentiment.</summary><category term="World" /></entry><entry><title>How Ethiopia's constitutional reform gives PM more power</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:3b525a7d7a72116c6cb9ff072363dc6dc7d9735dc97ab3d0121818e0c6a36086</id><updated>2026-09-10T12:59:58Z</updated><published>2026-09-09T15:18:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/how-ethiopia-s-constitutional-reform-gives-pm-more-power/a-79172262--92eff7ca7862.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/how-ethiopia-s-constitutional-reform-gives-pm-more-power/a-79172262?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">Does Ethiopian Prime Minister Abiy Ahmed stand to benefit from a planned constitutional reform in the country? A new presidential system would reshape political power — and could give him even more power in office.</summary><category term="World" /></entry><entry><title>Oil prices rise as Middle East conflict escalates</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:16af4d630f22d16ffb8411efd84bb673c9d291bc7f527e14bb000eb5455d9e01</id><updated>2026-09-10T12:58:37Z</updated><published>2026-09-09T14:16:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/oil-prices-rise-as-middle-east-conflict-escalates/a-79203547--69f3e58c677b.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/oil-prices-rise-as-middle-east-conflict-escalates/a-79203547?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">The price of oil returned to triple digits in US dollars, as conflict in the Middle East threatens supply chains and puts a strain on global reserves.</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>Syria arms depot explosion kills at least 14</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:2690309a801d6ff1bdc39ef073e2ef86eb28b89e63ddcdf1e49e01c0739b62c6</id><updated>2026-09-10T12:58:37Z</updated><published>2026-09-09T13:53:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/syria-arms-depot-explosion-kills-at-least-14/a-79203314--22d7b8669d08.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/syria-arms-depot-explosion-kills-at-least-14/a-79203314?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">The explosion struck near the Syrian city of Sarmada in Idlib province in the northwest. The Defense Ministry said the weapons and remnants from the war were being stored temporarily at the site before being relocated.</summary><category term="News" /></entry></feed>
